WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,510
Huzi, why are you here?

2
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,020
Sister hunted the rabbit

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,100
You want me to bring you here along the way

4
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,940
Bring something with you every time you come

5
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:14,510
Just in time to improve food for small foreign provinces

6
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:15,790
Avoid eating fish all day

7
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:19,130
When the time comes, you will be arrogant when you talk bubbles.

8
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:30,160
Brother-in-law, what happened to me and made me excited?

9
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,600
Accountant Wang insisted that he disagreed.

10
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:33,510
In those days, the land distribution system was distributed to each household

11
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:34,950
Isn’t my family assigned to dig the land?

12
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:37,150
Finally spent a lot of money to convert it into a fish pond

13
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:38,910
I conveniently opened the Wumu Wasteland next to me.

14
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:40,390
As a result, the village asked for the five mother lands

15
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:41,510
Two thousand bags per year

16
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:47,060
I remembered the one-time payment for five years.

17
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,700
Later it was because of this

18
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:51,700
The eldest brother-in-law's fish pond was poisoned by someone and the fish dog was poisoned to death.

19
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,200
It took my eldest brother-in-law and his family two years to recover.

20
00:00:55,630 --> 00:00:57,150
In my previous life, my eldest brother-in-law helped me a lot

21
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:58,820
Now that I've been reborn

22
00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:01,750
This can never happen again. It's really not okay.

23
00:01:01,990 --> 00:01:02,990
I separated the fish pond

24
00:01:03,230 --> 00:01:04,390
That Five Mother Wasteland was in vain

25
00:01:04,550 --> 00:01:07,860
The remaining nine female fish are enough for my brother-in-law

26
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:09,300
It's not that simple

27
00:01:09,870 --> 00:01:21,250
I'm afraid your Jiu Mu Fish Pond has been targeted by Hu Zi. What do you mean, brother-in-law, I ask you.

28
00:01:21,770 --> 00:01:23,970
Has anyone approached you recently about contracting a fish pond?

29
00:01:24,370 --> 00:01:27,140
Want to contract a fish pond?

30
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:28,620
But there is a book from afar

31
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:30,180
I want to use the 20 acres of land at home

32
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:31,340
In exchange for my dozen mothers and eight places

33
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:33,620
But now my land is irrigated with water every year

34
00:01:33,780 --> 00:01:37,400
It’s much better than Twenty Mu Hao Land, so I didn’t change your distant book quilt.

35
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,280
Are you close to any official in the village?

36
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:42,200
Li Youtian's son-in-law

37
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:44,780
Li Youtian

38
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:46,660
I said that the five mothers opened Geng land

39
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:48,220
No matter what, I can’t let go of Xiaojun Baobao

40
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,040
Palace Army Hu Zi

41
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,920
Don't think of people so badly

42
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,600
What we divided at the beginning was broken land

43
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,760
It's because of the hard work of the two of us

44
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,920
The newly renovated fish pond

45
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,640
Just because his father-in-law is the village elder sister

46
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,440
Don't say that your fish pond has no contracting procedures

47
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,000
There is just a formality and people really want it.

48
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,560
There are ways to take it away

49
00:02:20,790 --> 00:02:22,710
Who would put some poison in there in the middle of the night?

50
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:30,220
Something without evidence

51
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:32,340
No one bothered to call the police
